<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Auspine shares to be reinstated - ASX.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Auspine shares to be reinstated - ASX.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in timber producer Auspine Ltd will be reinstated from the start of trading, the Australian Stock Exchange (ASX) said.</p>
<p>The reinstatement follows the company providing a statement for release to the market regarding a referral made to the Australian Securities Commission (ASC), the ASX said.</p>
</text>
